5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about how often our plans fell apart when weather or transport failed us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am curious why we keep proposing things that look suspiciously like the ones we quietly buried six years ago.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I am interested in whether the skills required for these new services actually exist on our current staff roster.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I am concerned that the funding structure looks solid now but will crumble by year two.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I keep thinking about who can actually get to the branches. The locations and hours shape who we reach.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, that is a fair point. I want to see if those old programmes actually failed or just got unlucky.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, I suspect they failed because the records were never properly closed. I will check the two programmes begun six years ago.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, buried programmes often hide skill gaps. I will check the volunteer register and supervision training to see who is actually qualified.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I agree. I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment to see how the funding is structured.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, that makes sense. I will look into the bus links in the two outer wards to see who is actually cut off.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, I will check the winter road closures north of the river. I need to know exactly when access becomes impossible.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, if the skills are missing, the new service is just a fancy label for the old failure. I will check the running and equipment lines last year.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, equipment lines show maintenance, not capability. I will check evening room bookings and remote catalogue use to see actual demand patterns.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, demand patterns matter, but I need to see the cash flow. I will check the quoted delivery windows from suppliers to understand timing risks.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, timing is critical for access. I will check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops to see who actually showed up.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I will also check the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. I want to see if the community is ready to help us out.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. I need to see if the audience was ever there to begin with.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will also check the running and equipment lines last year. I need to see if the infrastructure supports the skills we claim to have.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will also check the running and equipment lines last year. I need to see where the hidden costs actually sit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will also check the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use. I need to see when people actually come.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
